  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3305.03 Periodic Review of Farmer Participation. The department shall conduct reviews at least once during a current farmer’s participation period using the selection criteria as described in He-P 3305.01(b).\n\nSource. #14200, eff 2-26-25",
